  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 87 − 3 + 39 ÷ 67 × 3 = −133.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and −**\n\nGiven: 87 − 3 + 39 ÷ 67 × 3 = −133 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**87 ÷ 3**__ + 39 - 67 × 3 = −133 \n\n⇒ 29 + 39 - __**67 × 3**__ = −133 \n\n⇒ __**29 + 39**__ - 201 = −133 \n\n⇒ __**68 - 201**__ = −133 \n\n⇒** -133 = -133**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\nGiven: 87 − 3 + 39 ÷ 67 × 3 = −133 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 87 − __**3 × 39 ÷ 67**__ + 3 = −133 \n\n⇒ __**87**__ − 1.75 __**+ 3**__ = −133 \n\n⇒ __90 - 1.75__ = -133\n\n⇒ 88.25 ≠ -133\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and -\n\nGiven: 87 − 3 + 39 ÷ 67 × 3 = −133 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 87 × 3 + __**39 ÷ 67**__ - 3 = −133 \n\n⇒ __**87 × 3**__ + 0.59 - 3 = −133 \n\n⇒ __**261 + 0.59**__ - 3 = −133 \n\n⇒ __261.59____ - 3__ = -133\n\n⇒ 258.59 ≠ -133\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) - and +\n\nGiven: 87 − 3 + 39 ÷ 67 × 3 = −133 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 87 + 3 - __**39 ÷ 67 × 3**__ = −133 \n\n⇒ __**87 +**____** 3**__ - 1.75 = −133 \n\n⇒ __90 - 1.75__ = -133\n\n⇒ 88.25 ≠ -133\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
